cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Kimi-K3 on Apple Silicon / MLX"
abstract: >-
  Runs the complete 2.8-trillion-parameter Kimi-K3 checkpoint (~1.42 TiB, all 93
  language-model layers) on a 64 GiB M4 Pro Mac mini by streaming mixture-of-experts
  weights from an external NVMe SSD, with native MLX/Metal execution.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Derezinski
    given-names: Steve
repository-code: "https://github.com/sjdthree/kimi-k3-mlx-macmini"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - mlx
  - apple-silicon
  - mixture-of-experts
  - llm-inference
  - ssd-offloading
  - kimi-k3
